        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miner Clicker</strong> is a mix between an idle and a clicker game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short indie game, you find yourself in a mine where you can click to dig, gather resources, and buy upgrades!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/ba1cb7b5f1a89393bf78cbf7ddfa9cea.poster.avif?t=1761334574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/ba1cb7b5f1a89393bf78cbf7ddfa9cea.webm?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/ba1cb7b5f1a89393bf78cbf7ddfa9cea.mp4?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach the Depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the rarer the ores you’ll find! Earn tons of money to spend on powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/3cc621e1de3639bab9a3fc09ed57acc7.poster.avif?t=1761334574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/3cc621e1de3639bab9a3fc09ed57acc7.webm?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/3cc621e1de3639bab9a3fc09ed57acc7.mp4?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Your Money to Dig Easier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy pickaxes or collectors to help you dig faster, or save up to purchase upgrades that make you faster, stronger, and richer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/30825107394c1db5b6a4d4f0d10519b7.poster.avif?t=1761334574\" width=648 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/30825107394c1db5b6a4d4f0d10519b7.webm?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/30825107394c1db5b6a4d4f0d10519b7.mp4?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miner Clicker</strong> is a mix between an idle and a clicker game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this short indie game, you find yourself in a mine where you can click to dig, gather resources, and buy upgrades!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/ba1cb7b5f1a89393bf78cbf7ddfa9cea.poster.avif?t=1761334574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/ba1cb7b5f1a89393bf78cbf7ddfa9cea.webm?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/ba1cb7b5f1a89393bf78cbf7ddfa9cea.mp4?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reach the Depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the rarer the ores you’ll find! Earn tons of money to spend on powerful upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/3cc621e1de3639bab9a3fc09ed57acc7.poster.avif?t=1761334574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/3cc621e1de3639bab9a3fc09ed57acc7.webm?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/3cc621e1de3639bab9a3fc09ed57acc7.mp4?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Your Money to Dig Easier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy pickaxes or collectors to help you dig faster, or save up to purchase upgrades that make you faster, stronger, and richer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/30825107394c1db5b6a4d4f0d10519b7.poster.avif?t=1761334574\" width=648 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/30825107394c1db5b6a4d4f0d10519b7.webm?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849630/extras/30825107394c1db5b6a4d4f0d10519b7.mp4?t=1761334574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
